stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> anonymous
    anonymous --> otp_pending: intent requires account data
    otp_pending --> otp_verified: OTP correct
    otp_pending --> otp_pending: wrong OTP (attempt 1 or 2)
    otp_pending --> locked: 3 failed attempts
    locked --> escalated_security: route to security queue
    otp_verified --> biometric_verified: high-risk action and device biometric ok
    otp_verified --> full_kyc: KYC-gated request and KYC check ok
    biometric_verified --> full_kyc: KYC-gated request and KYC check ok
    otp_verified --> anonymous: 5 min inactivity
    biometric_verified --> anonymous: 5 min inactivity
    full_kyc --> anonymous: 5 min inactivity
    anonymous --> [*]

    note right of otp_pending
        The agent never asks the customer to
        share an OTP in chat on voice or
        social channels. The OTP is entered
        in the secure in-app widget.
        Never accepted: PIN, CVV, full card or full Aadhaar.
    end note
